  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Symposium - Global Procurement Initiative: Understanding Best Value Technical Assistance for the Government of Kenya, through Enterprise - United States Unknown</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This technical assistance (TA) grant provides funding for technical advisory services to assist national and county-level procuring and oversight entities in Kenya as part of USTDA&apos;s Global Procurement Initiative: Understanding Best Value (GPI) partnership with the Government of Kenya (GoK). The technical assistance is composed of four separate components: (1) the development of a Value-for-Money (VfM) Procurement Manual; (2) training on how to implement and roll out the guidelines and procedures detailed in the Manual; (3) in-depth training on LCCA; and (4) the development of a Public Procurement Guide for Vendors/Suppliers on VfM guidelines.</narrative>
  </description>
